margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>1.- Erzurum Milletvekili
Zehra Ta&#351;kesenlio&#287;lu Ban’&#305;n, kad&#305;na yönelik &#351;iddetle
mücadeleye ili&#351;kin gündem d&#305;&#351;&#305; konu&#351;mas&#305;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>2.- Ni&#287;de Milletvekili
Ömer Fethi Gürer’in, çiftçilerin sorunlar&#305;na ili&#351;kin gündem
d&#305;&#351;&#305; konu&#351;mas&#305;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>3.- Aksaray Milletvekili Ramazan
Ka&#351;l&#305;’n&#305;n, Aksaray’a yap&#305;lan yat&#305;r&#305;mlar ve “2023
Lider Ülke Türkiye” vizyonuna do&#287;ru yap&#305;lmas&#305; planlanan
çal&#305;&#351;malara ili&#351;kin gündem d&#305;&#351;&#305;
konu&#351;mas&#305;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
