<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>2.- Mersin Milletvekili Olcay
K&#305;lavuz’un, POMEM al&#305;mlar&#305;na ve ö&#287;renci aff&#305;, ehliyet
aff&#305; ve bedelli aff&#305; beklentilerine ili&#351;kin aç&#305;klamas&#305;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>3.- Bursa Milletvekili Yüksel
Özkan’&#305;n, Sa&#287;l&#305;k Bakan&#305; Fahrettin Koca’n&#305;n Avrupa
ülkelerindeki Covid-19 hastalar&#305;n&#305; Türkiye’de tedavi edebileceklerine
dair aç&#305;klamas&#305;na ili&#351;kin aç&#305;klamas&#305;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>4.- Konya Milletvekili
Abdulkadir Karaduman’&#305;n, engelli ö&#287;retmen adaylar&#305;n&#305;n
atanmay&#305; bekledi&#287;ine ili&#351;kin aç&#305;klamas&#305;<o:p></o:p></span></p>

<p class=MsoNormal style='margin-top:3.0pt;margin-right:0cm;margin-bottom:3.0pt;
margin-left:0cm;text-align:justify;text-indent:42.55pt;tab-stops:center 255.0pt'><span
style='font-size:9.0pt;mso-bidi-font-size:12.0pt'>5.- Trabzon Milletvekili
Ahmet Kaya’n&#305;n, ta&#351;erondan sürekli i&#351;çi kadrosuna geçirilen
